<title>USA: Sonics &amp; Materials gets surgery product OK.</title>
<headline>Sonics &amp; Materials gets surgery product OK.</headline>
<dateline>DANBURY, Conn. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sonics &amp; Materials Inc said Thursday that it has received Section 510(k) approval from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration for its Vibra-Surge System Model VS2120 Ultrasonic Surgical Instrument.</p>
<p>This approval permits the company to market the device for aiding the removal of soft tissue in general surgery and plastic and reconstructive surgery.</p>
